{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43251","headline":"海上生明月 · 朱华","name":"海上生明月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皎皎秋中月，团圆海上生。\n影开金镜满，轮抱玉壶清。\n渐出三山𡵒，将凌一汉横\n素娥尝药去，乌鹊遶枝惊。\n照水光偏白，浮云色最明。\n此时尧砌下，蓂荚自将荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱华","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43251.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43251","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}